meta {
  name: Preview jobs
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/job-previews
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  ~skill: typescript
  ~city: Berlin
}

docs {
  Public teaser for prospects (no login): the 7 newest active jobs. Both filters are optional; repeat a param for several values (OR-ed).

  - `skill`: one of typescript, javascript, python, java, csharp, go, sql, react, next-js, angular, vue-js, node-js, docker, kubernetes, aws
  - `city`: one of Berlin, Munich, Hamburg, Frankfurt am Main, Cologne

  - 200: OK - `{ items, total }`; at most 7 `items`, `total` counts all matching jobs; items have `isSaved: false`, `match: null` and no `sourceUrl`
  - 400: invalid filter
}
